  "description": "VoltBike is proud to present our newest eTrike, the Trio V2. This model builds on all the great features of the original Trio, but with a dual-battery format. Combined, the 20ah internal battery, and 15ah external battery offer a combined 35 amp hours of pure delight.\nOur 350W front-hub motor offers ample power and responsiveness. With 9 levels of Pedal Assistance as well as a throttle, this powerful electric trike is ready to take on hills and trails.\nA spacious rear cargo area allows you to bring everything you need with you, with room to spare.\nIf you're looking for a stable, fun, eTrike, that will go very far, the Trio V2 is the best choice.",
